This spell was used by [[Eathon Lambert]] to help [[Simon Judeau]] save [[Metz]] from falling into a pool of liquid hot magma. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

His son, [[Lok Lambert]] used this to distract an [[Enforcer]] {{source|The Golden Asp}}

[[Dante Vale]] used Ropetrick in for [[Solwing]] to tie up a group of defeated [[Silent Soldiers]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

Lok later used the spell to tie up [[Wind]] in the [[Phoenix Volcano]]. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}.

